00:14:03,500 --> 00:14:07,410
Our standard order is: The steamed dumpling appetizer,general tso's chicken,

255
00:14:07,420 --> 00:14:11,130
beef with broccoli,shrimp with lobster sauce and vegetable lo mein.

256
00:14:11,140 --> 00:14:13,460
Do you see the problem?

257
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:16,810
I see a problem.

258
00:14:16,820 --> 00:14:19,200
Our entire order is predicated on four dumplings

259
00:14:19,210 --> 00:14:23,910
and four entrees divided amongst four people.

260
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:27,210
So,we'll just order three entrees.

261
00:14:27,220 --> 00:14:28,660
Fine. What do you want to eliminate?

262
00:14:28,670 --> 00:14:30,590
And who gets the extra dumpling?

263
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,110
We could cut it into thirds.

264
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,370
Then it's no longer a dumpling.

265
00:14:33,380 --> 00:14:37,530
Once you cut it open it is,at best,a very small open-faced sandwich.

266
00:14:38,140 --> 00:14:39,390
Hi,fellas.

267
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:43,620
Oh,where's your annoying little friend who thinks he speaks mandarin?

268
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:46,490
He's putting his needs ahead of the collective good.

269
00:14:46,500 --> 00:14:49,750
Where he comes from,that's punishable by death.

270
00:14:49,760 --> 00:14:52,350
I come from sacramento.

271
00:14:56,150 --> 00:14:58,840
Can we get an order of dumplings but with three instead of four?

272
00:14:58,850 --> 00:15:00,760
No substitutions.

273
00:15:00,770 --> 00:15:03,390
This isn't a substitution. It's a reduction.

274
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:06,890
- Okay.No reductions. - Fine.

275
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:08,990
Uh,bring us three orders of dumplings.

276
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,810
That's 12. We'll each have four.

277
00:15:10,820 --> 00:15:11,360
That works.

278
00:15:11,370 --> 00:15:14,400
No. If we fill up on dumplings,we need to eliminate another entree.

279
00:15:14,410 --> 00:15:16,530
No eliminations.

280
00:15:17,270 --> 00:15:19,570
If we have extra,we'll just take the leftovers home.

281
00:15:19,580 --> 00:15:20,400
And divide it how?

282
00:15:20,410 --> 00:15:23,250
I'm telling you,we cannot do this without wolowitz.

283
00:15:23,260 --> 00:15:24,910
Wolowitz is with his new girlfriend.

284
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:27,620
If you had let me invite penny,then you would have had your fourth.

285
00:15:27,630 --> 00:15:29,280
Have you seen penny eat chinese food?

286
00:15:29,290 --> 00:15:32,480
She uses a fork and she double-dips her egg rolls.

287
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:33,880
We don't order egg rolls.

288
00:15:33,890 --> 00:15:36,180
Exactly,but we'd have to if she was here!

289
00:15:36,190 --> 00:15:37,590
Can we please make a decision?

290
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:39,390
Not only are there children starving in india,

291
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:41,790
there's an indian starving right here.

292
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:45,670
There's an idea. Why don't we just go out for indian food?

293
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:49,520
You're nice boys.

294
00:15:49,530 --> 00:15:51,020
Tell you what I'm going to do.

295
00:15:51,030 --> 00:15:53,110
I'm going to bring you the four dumplings.

296
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:54,990
When I'm walking over to the table,

297
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,890
maybe I get bumped,one of the dumplings fall to the floor.

298
00:15:57,900 --> 00:16:00,000
No one has to know.

299
00:16:00,870 --> 00:16:02,820
I'll know.

300
00:16:08,030 --> 00:16:08,970
how about soup?

301
00:16:08,980 --> 00:16:10,470
Yeah,we can always divide soup.

302
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:12,680
What about the wontons?

303
00:16:19,070 --> 00:16:20,200
Hey,guys,what's up?

304
00:16:20,210 --> 00:16:22,210
It's halo night.

305
00:16:23,230 --> 00:16:25,360
Yeah? Okay.

306
00:16:26,270 --> 00:16:27,820
So?

307
00:16:28,310 --> 00:16:31,400
Well,with wolowitz spending all of his time with your friend christy...

308
00:16:31,410 --> 00:16:32,370
she's not my friend.

309
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:35,550
Friends do not get their friends' care bears all sweaty.

310
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:40,360
Right. Anyway,uh,with wolowitz occupied elsewhere,

311
00:16:40,370 --> 00:16:43,090
we had something we wanted to ask you.

312
00:16:43,100 --> 00:16:45,000
- Sheldon? - Yes.

313
00:16:47,780 --> 00:16:49,040
penny...

314
00:16:49,050 --> 00:16:51,410
we would very much appreciate

315
00:16:51,410 --> 00:16:54,380
it if you would be the fourth member of our halo team.

316
00:16:54,390 --> 00:16:58,380
I don't think I need to tell you what an honor this is.

317
00:17:00,690 --> 00:17:03,800
Oh,that's so sweet,but I'm going out dancing with a girlfriend.

318
00:17:03,810 --> 00:17:06,360
You can't go out; it's halo night.

319
00:17:07,030 --> 00:17:09,210
Well,for penny,it's dancing night.

320
00:17:09,220 --> 00:17:10,710
You go dancing every wednesday?

321
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:12,810
No. Then that's not "dancing night."

322
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:16,290
Look,why don't I play with you guys tomorrow?

323
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:17,520
Tonight is halo night.

324
00:17:17,530 --> 00:17:19,630
It's like talking to a wall.

325
00:17:20,930 --> 00:17:24,210
All right,now,sheldon,you and I are about to have a problem.

326
00:17:26,370 --> 00:17:28,610
Sheldon,remember,we role-played this.

327
00:17:28,620 --> 00:17:31,670
Yes,but you didn't portray her as completely irrational.

328
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:33,880
All right,fellas,I gotta go.

329
00:17:33,890 --> 00:17:35,970
But good luck.

330
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:42,370
Maybe we should've asked if we could go dancing with her and her girlfriend.

331
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:44,610
Okay,assuming we could dance-- which we can't--

332
00:17:44,620 --> 00:17:47,040
there are three of us and two of them.

333
00:17:47,050 --> 00:17:47,760
So?

334
00:17:47,770 --> 00:17:50,970
It's the chinese restaurant all over again.

335
00:17:51,340 --> 00:17:54,000
I assure you that cutting a dumpling in thirds is child's play

336
00:17:54,010 --> 00:17:57,990
compared with three men each attempting to dance with 67% of a woman.

337
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:03,710
Oh,for god's sakes,sheldon,you're driving me crazy!

338
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:05,770
Your anger is not with me,sir,but with basic mathematics.

339
00:18:05,780 --> 00:18:07,760
No. I'm pretty sure my anger is with you.

340
00:18:07,770 --> 00:18:10,810
What's happening to us? We're falling apart.

341
00:18:12,510 --> 00:18:13,370
Who are you calling?

342
00:18:13,380 --> 00:18:17,700
The only man who can restore any semblance of balance to our universe.

343
00:18:17,710 --> 00:18:19,460
Hi,this is howard wolowitz.

344
00:18:19,470 --> 00:18:21,150
And this is christy vanderbelt.

345
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:24,840
We can't get to the phone right now because we're having sex!

346
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:29,130
You're not going to put that on your message,are you?

347
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:32,230
Nah,I'm just kidding. I'll re-record it.

348
00:18:35,210 --> 00:18:36,490
sheldon,think this through.

349
00:18:36,500 --> 00:18:39,730
You're going to ask howard to choose between sex and halo.

350
00:18:39,740 --> 00:18:43,940
No,I'm going to ask him to choose between sex and halo three.

351
00:18:43,950 --> 00:18:46,680
As far as I know,sex has not been upgraded

352
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:49,300
to include hi-def graphics and enhanced weapon systems.

353
00:18:49,310 --> 00:18:53,660
You're right,all sex has is nudity,orgasms and human contact.

354
00:18:53,670 --> 00:18:55,080
My point.

355
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:59,740
I'm just saying,you can take the damn plastic off the couch once in a while!

356
00:18:59,750 --> 00:19:02,870
Why,so you and howard can hump on it?

357
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:06,220
Ladies,ladies,I'm sure there's a middle ground.

358
00:19:06,230 --> 00:19:08,580
Shut up,howard!

359
00:19:08,770 --> 00:19:09,780
You know what,you guys talk.

360
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:12,120
I'm gonna take my scooter out for a little spin.

361
00:19:12,130 --> 00:19:14,510
You happy? You drove your own son out of the house.

362
00:19:14,910 --> 00:19:17,550
hey,what are you guys doing here?

363
00:19:17,560 --> 00:19:19,590
It's halo night.

364
00:19:19,870 --> 00:19:21,350
He's not a man,he's a putz!

365
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:23,810
And don't you take that tone with me,you gold digger!

366
00:19:23,820 --> 00:19:24,720
What'd you call me?

367
00:19:24,730 --> 00:19:25,730
You heard me!

368
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:28,910
And I'll tell you something else,you're barking up the wrong tree.

369
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:32,190
'Cause as long as you're around,howard is out of the will!

370
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:33,960
You know what? I got better offers.

371
00:19:33,970 --> 00:19:35,580
I'm outta here.

372
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:36,310
that's right.

373
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:39,270
Go back to babylon,you whore!

374
00:19:42,670 --> 00:19:44,590
So,halo night,huh?

375
00:19:46,830 --> 00:19:49,000
I thought she was the whore of omaha.

376
00:19:56,280 --> 00:19:57,970
sheldon,you got him in your sights! Fire!

377
00:19:57,980 --> 00:19:59,750
He's charging his plasma rifle!

378
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:00,500
I can't shoot now.

379
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:01,320
I'm cloaking!

380
00:20:01,330 --> 00:20:02,730
Now,raj! Kill sheldon!

381
00:20:02,740 --> 00:20:03,760
I can't see him!

382
00:20:03,770 --> 00:20:06,260
That's why they call it cloaking,dead man!

383
00:20:06,540 --> 00:20:07,760
Start throwing grenades!

384
00:20:07,770 --> 00:20:09,490
I'm all out!

385
00:20:09,870 --> 00:20:12,060
Hey,guys. My friends and I got tired of dancing,

386
00:20:12,070 --> 00:20:14,780
so we came over to have sex with you.

387
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:16,230
Raj,hop in the tank!

388
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:17,150
We said no tanks!

389
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:19,680
There are no rules in hell!

390
00:20:19,690 --> 00:20:21,500
Son of a bitch. Med pack!

391
00:20:21,510 --> 00:20:23,560
I need a med pack!

392
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:26,100
Told ya.

393
00:20:26,110 --> 00:20:28,250
There's a sniper. Use your rocket launcher!

394
00:20:28,260 --> 00:20:30,900
All I've got is a needler and I'm all out of ammo!

395
00:20:30,910 --> 00:20:33,060
And now you're out of life.

396
00:20:35,190 --> 00:20:36,770
why'd you hit pause?

397
00:20:36,780 --> 00:20:39,340
I thought I heard... something.

398
00:20:39,350 --> 00:20:40,520
What?

399
00:20:40,530 --> 00:20:43,830
No,n-never mind. Sorry.Go.

